sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant C as CLI / API
    participant R as Retriever
    participant RT as ParteRouter<br/>Haiku 4.5
    participant P as PageIndex<br/>Opus 5.5
    participant A as Answerer
    participant L as Citations API<br/>Opus 5.5

    U->>C: question (Spanish)
    Note over C: planned: rewrite into a Standalone question
    C->>R: Standalone question
    R->>RT: question + one card per loaded Parte<br/>(code, título, root summary, top-level divisions)
    RT-->>R: routed Partes, most relevant first<br/>(JSON enum of loaded codes, may be empty)
    loop each routed Parte
        R->>P: chat(question, tree of the Parte)
        P-->>R: tool calls get_page_content(pages)
        opt a Sección read has a Remisión worth reading
            P->>R: follow_reference(desde, hacia)
            R-->>P: text of the referenced Sección<br/>(one hop, any loaded Parte)
        end
    end
    R->>R: PDF pages read + followed Secciones → Secciones
    R->>A: Retrieval (Secciones + visited nodes)
    A->>L: one document per Sección<br/>(one content block per PDF page), citations on
    L-->>A: text blocks with cited_text + block ranges
    A->>A: split into sentences, map Citations,<br/>keep claims with Citations (+ Framing, planned)
    A-->>C: Answer (sentences + Citations)
    C-->>U: Answer with numbered Citations
